WEBVTT

intro
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000
<v Leon>For a static handheld scene, take a test photo and inspect it for blur before changing settings.</v>

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:16.000
<v Leon>If camera shake blurs the scene, try a faster shutter. A faster shutter reduces the captured light; compensate with aperture or ISO and take another test photo.</v>

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
<v Leon>A faster shutter does not fix missed focus. Check which part of the image is sharp before attributing all blur to camera shake.</v>
